pageType: content
background:
  type: image
  src: "media/template-inner.png"
  fit: {mode: cover}
elements:
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [58, 44, 820, 48]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      text: 案例二｜限额治理从规则模型到状态机
  - elementId: lead
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 100, 840, 30]
    content:
      style: "$subtitle"
      text: 将“超限处理”拆分为度量、规则、动作、恢复和异常保护，避免判定与执行耦合成不可解释的黑盒。
  - elementId: s1
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 158, 180, 92]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pale"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: s1t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [76, 176, 148, 56]
    content:
      align: [center, middle]
      fontSize: 18
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      text: 度量选择
  - elementId: s2
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [286, 146, 180, 116]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$red"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: s2t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [300, 164, 152, 80]
    content:
      align: [center, middle]
      fontSize: 18
      bold: true
      color: "$white"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      text: |
        <p>规则匹配</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px">Default → Override</p>
  - elementId: s3
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [512, 158, 180, 92]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$pale"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$blue"}
  - elementId: s3t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [526, 176, 152, 56]
    content:
      align: [center, middle]
      fontSize: 18
      bold: true
      color: "$ink"
      text: 超限状态
  - elementId: s4
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [738, 146, 162, 116]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$blue"}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$blue"}
  - elementId: s4t
    elementType: text
    bounds: [752, 164, 134, 80]
    content:
      align: [center, middle]
      fontSize: 17
      bold: true
      color: "$white"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      text: |
        <p>协调闭环</p>
        <p style="font-size:14px">reason · expires_at</p>
  - elementId: a1
    elementType: line
    bounds: [240, 204, 46, 2]
    viewBox: [46, 2]
    points: "0,1 46,1"
    arrow: [null, stealth]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: a2
    elementType: line
    bounds: [466, 204, 46, 2]
    viewBox: [46, 2]
    points: "0,1 46,1"
    arrow: [null, stealth]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$blue"}
  - elementId: a3
    elementType: line
    bounds: [692, 204, 46, 2]
    viewBox: [46, 2]
    points: "0,1 46,1"
    arrow: [null, stealth]
    border: {style: solid, width: 2, color: "$red"}
  - elementId: b1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 314, 250, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>默认与覆盖</strong></p>
        <p>先按 Key Hash 查找覆盖规则，未命中再使用默认值；缺省 fallback model 使用稳定默认值。</p>
  - elementId: b2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [355, 314, 250, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>动作与状态</strong></p>
        <p>pause、downgrade、notify 分离记录，状态带 reason、expires_at 与可追溯来源。</p>
  - elementId: b3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [650, 314, 250, 130]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      text: |
        <p><strong>异常保护</strong></p>
        <p>上游状态读取失败时保留现状，不把网络错误解释为“没有暂停”。</p>
  - elementId: source
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 474, 840, 20]
    content:
      style: "$bodySmall"
      fontSize: 11
      text: 方案重点：策略可解释、动作可切换、状态可恢复、异常不产生猜测性变更。
